#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:75
#: 2670ae67747844f6aace0e8680552ad4
msgid "Providing feedback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/testing.rst:78
#: ec2617d3e7fa4dc9adda92c9907f95b4
msgid ""
"Since the whole point of testing software is to discover and fix bugs, your "
"feedback is an essential part of this process. We use an `automated build "
"process <https://github.com/QubesOS/qubes-infrastructure/blob/master/"
"README.md>`__. For every package that is uploaded to a testing repository, a "
"GitHub issue is created in the `updates-status <https://github.com/QubesOS/"
"updates-status/issues>`__ repository for tracking purposes. We welcome any "
"kind of feedback on any package in any testing repository. Even a simple |"
"thumbsup| “thumbs up” or |thumbsdown| “thumbs down” reaction on the "
"package’s associated issue would help us to decide whether the package is "
"ready to be migrated to a stable repository. If you :doc:`report a bug </"
"introduction/issue-tracking>` in a package that is in a testing repository, "
"please reference the appropriate issue in `updates-status <https://"
"github.com/QubesOS/updates-status/issues>`__."
msgstr ""

